92:  }
```

Navigation observer `fresh()` — lines 522–525:
```
522:  function fresh(frameId) {
523:    requireFact(latest&&latest.frameId===frameId&&clock()>=latest.started&&clock()-latest.started<=5000,
524:      'FRESH_CAPTURE_REQUIRED');
